      "writtenOn": "2025-03-10T20:53:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BTW, I am still working the CL chain (this CL is the first one).\n\nCurrently the init, thread creation, and logic of waiting the thread initialized are grouped together in `drv-\u003einit_ppm(pdc_dev)` or `ucsi_ppm_init_and_wait()`. I am trying to decouple the init part and the thread part. The init part can be done in `INIT_APPLICATION` as before, while the thread part needs to be deferred to the `main()`, similar to the `pdc_power_mgmt` thread.",
      "parentUuid": "6681a1e0_659857e5",
      "revId": "325533b009015e6a9a7997aaa2fd6d72bf5bcd53",
